	&lt;figcaption&gt;
	United Airlines passenger planes are seen at gates at Newark Liberty International Airport (EWR) in Newark, New Jersey, on November 15, 2026. | AFP via Getty Images	&lt;/figcaption&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Less than a week after an issue with air traffic control communications and radar &lt;a href="https://www.theverge.com/transportation/1034039/faa-aviation-glitch-meltdown-ground-stop"&gt;caused the FAA to halt takeoffs nationwide&lt;/a&gt;, United Airlines departing flights are being disrupted by an outage. At 6:13PM ET, United &lt;a href="https://x.com/united/status/2122468207202279437" data-type="link" data-id="https://x.com/united/status/2122468207202279437"&gt;said&lt;/a&gt; the problem has been fixed:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow"&gt;
&lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Earlier today we experienced a technology-related issue that impacted some departing flights. The issue has been resolved. Please check the latest status of your flight at united.com or the United app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;The outage is also coming after &lt;a href="https://www.theverge.com/tech/1034538/microsoft-365-outlook-outage-hotel-chlorine-poisoning"&gt;last week's global Microsoft Outlook shutdown&lt;/a&gt;, and the &lt;a href="https://www.theverge.com/news/1034952/chase-bank-outage-down-bank-of-america-wells-fargo-zelle"&gt;great-bank-outage-that-wasn't&lt;/a&gt; earlier Monday afternoon. According to &lt;a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/unitedairlines/comments/1xy2eqc/comment/19sqq1twwtyrn/"&gt;posts&lt;/a&gt; on &lt;a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/unitedairlines/comments/1xy2eqc/comment/19sqpzi6qutz8/?share_id=nDmvlGiCyVyr3M_Yhd_C6&amp;amp;utm_medium=android_app&amp;amp;utm_name=androidcss&amp;amp;utm_source=share&amp;amp;utm_term=1"&gt;social media&lt;/a&gt;, a number of peop …&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.theverge.com/transportation/1035025/united-airlines-outage-down-departures"&gt;Read the full story at The Verge.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
						
									</description></item><item><title>In Get Huge, the manosphere is here to make friends — with deadly consequences</title><link>https://www.theverge.com/entertainment/1033466/hulu-disney-plus-get-huge-looksmaxxing-to-death</link><guid>https://www.theverge.com/?p=1033466</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:41:57 -0500</pubDate><description>
											

						
